# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Flow: Stonard -> hearth to Camp Mojache (Neeru's task, the Northspring and Uzer'i's quests
# taken for later) -> fly to Gadgetzan (bind) -> Sandsorrow Watch -> Gadgetzan -> Marvon
# Rivetseeker -> the Noxious Lair -> Thistleshrub Valley -> Tooga's escort to Steamwheedle Port
# (the Lost Rigger Cove quests and the screechers handed in) -> Gadgetzan -> Marvon -> Scrimshank's
# gear -> Gadgetzan.
#
# Accepted here, finished later on the route: Wild Hearts (3123: the Hinterlands owlbeasts),
# Natural Materials (3128) and Vengeance on the Northspring (3063) in Feralas at 49, Sprinkle's
# Secret Ingredient (2641: the Violet Tragan grows in the Hinterlands), Rise of the Silithid (32,
# Orgrimmar on the way to the Hinterlands), Deliver to MacKinley (2874, Booty Bay around 51).
#
# Optional: Find and Rescue OOX-17/TN! (351, 648): the beacon is a rare drop; the reward waits with
# Oglethorpe in Booty Bay. Cortello's Riddle (625), for those who took the scroll: a short flight
# to Dustwallow Marsh and back.

